  <Itf Name="INode" Id="{2d52b12a-f93e-4225-88dd-602ade75bf2c}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This interface provides methods and properties that every node needs to implement.
Some of the methods and properties are used for the CNM HMI framework.

